--| A lift has one result (by induction on the term; the closed clause by `lift_closed_id`).
theorem lift_det (G: hyps) (tn tk te tz tw: set): $ G ⇒ ra_lift tn tk te tz ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_lift tn tk te tw ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ tz = tw $;

--| An instantiation has one result (by induction on the term; the closed clause by `inst_closed_below_id`, the
--| instantiated variable by `lift_det`).
theorem inst_det (G: hyps) (ta tk te tz tw: set): $ G ⇒ ra_inst tk te ta tz ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_inst tk te ta tw ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ tz = tw $;

--| `sinst` has one result (`tdd` types are put in; by induction on `tdd`, with `inst_det`).
theorem sinst_det (G: hyps) (td tj tn tk te tz tw tdd: set): $ G ⇒ ra_add tj tdd tn ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_sinst td tj tn tk te tz ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_sinst td tj tn tk te tw ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ tz = tw $;

