--| The constructor's rule in the model from the rule's premises (`ind_ctor_ty` with `ctor_ty`), at every block: the restored
--| type has the value of the type with the block's types put in (the specialization lemma and the constructors' lemma).
theorem ind_ctor_ty_all (G: hyps) (H J: class) (u w r tg td ti tc tCT: set):
  $ G ⇒ iwf u H J tg td w r $ > $ G ⇒ hctor ⊆ H $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ctor_ty td ti tc tCT ∈ lrel $ >
  $ G ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , scons td (scons ti (scons tc ∅)) ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) tCT w r $;

